{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829510/extras/25b402b99ee46c9f9fede204770db3e7.avif?t=1774469543\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829510/extras_big/25b402b99ee46c9f9fede204770db3e7.webp?t=1774469543 width=1560 height=410 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Microplastic Mayhem</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash chain lightning, ice spikes, and never-ending plagues. Over 100 evolutions and modifiers, game-bending power-ups, 56 chaotic synergies, and more to discover. The possibilities are endless.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Swarm Intelligence</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clever squirrels that think and act like a real swarm. Player awareness, spatial reasoning, and value-driven targeting let them bring the pain in the most effective way possible. Even at scale, they are an extension of your will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829510/extras/9f44b2f02a55b8c6522e18d6aeebfcbe.poster.avif?t=1774469543\" width=1170 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829510/extras/9f44b2f02a55b8c6522e18d6aeebfcbe.webm?t=1774469543\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829510/extras/9f44b2f02a55b8c6522e18d6aeebfcbe.mp4?t=1774469543\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Power In Numbers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Scurry</i> takes a mathematical approach to power-scaling, with compounding effects, exponential growth, and a hefty arsenal of purpose-built tools waiting to be tested.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Terrifying Potential</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock eight unique phenotypes as you climb the food chain. Each breed possesses traits that make them unparalleled in dealing punishment. Mix-and-match or take a purist's approach. Hone their abilities to make them unstoppable.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No Holding Back</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelite mechanics that open the doors to creative expression with nine ways to stack the odds in your favor. Creating the perfect swarm is a matter of personal taste as much as it is a path to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829510/extras/b88a79a3633584baa619dfa4078a45e9.poster.avif?t=1774469543\" width=1170 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829510/extras/b88a79a3633584baa619dfa4078a45e9.webm?t=1774469543\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829510/extras/b88a79a3633584baa619dfa4078a45e9.mp4?t=1774469543\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3829510?t=1774469543","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829510/54afbc7fb61790e4ec92cf8610566c5e5e33f1da/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774469543","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829510/5fbb29bc54145ec30a60a92f1ce910bb2c69d381/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774469543","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829510/5fbb29bc54145ec30a